think Third community-health file. The plan warns against admitting anything that only performs legitimacy, so I wrote a genuine conduct in the tree's civic voice rather than pasting a boilerplate Covenant — the standard names the values the tree already lives (be kind and assume kindness, be honest and say why, prefer yet to but, protect the newcomer, respect custody and consent).
think Kept it honest about the single-maintainer phase: reporting goes to the quiet channels (private advisory / maintainer contact), handling is proportional, and the fuller enforcement process is named as growing with the project (OPEN_QUESTIONS succession), not claimed as already built. That honesty is what makes it pass TAME and the two rooms rather than perform.
think Thanked the Contributor Covenant as prior art with a link (gratitude discipline) while keeping our own voice; ended on an earned radiant wish.
